# Cloudflare Pages edge redirects — processed before static-asset/SPA
# fallback matching, so these fire reliably regardless of what serving layer
# actually runs in production (confirmed 29 Oct 2026: the Express-level 301s
# in src/server.ts do NOT execute on this deployment — Cloudflare's static
# hosting serves the homepage's prerendered HTML as an SPA fallback for any
# unmatched path instead, which left a canonical-mismatch problem at these
# old URLs: a 200 response with the homepage's own <title>/<h1> and a
# canonical pointing at "/" — not a redirect, not the right page either).
#
# Exact-path rules only (no trailing "*"), so these do NOT catch the real
# image assets still served from /backdrops/backdrop-XX.jpg (public/backdrops/).
#
# /backdrops -> /party-decorations-singapore/ (28 Oct 2026 rename)
/backdrops            /party-decorations-singapore/   301
/backdrops/           /party-decorations-singapore/   301

# /party-decoration-singapore (singular SEO landing page, removed 28 Oct 2026
# — keyword-cannibalizing against the real portfolio page above)
/party-decoration-singapore    /party-decorations-singapore/   301
/party-decoration-singapore/   /party-decorations-singapore/   301
